%% Design diagram, hand-authored from IntakeConsent.tla; SC_RUN=mac-needed.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Claimed: Claim
    Claimed --> Accepted: accepted CAS + live owner
    Accepted --> Spawned: spawned CAS commits / sealed ticket
    Spawned --> Scoped: Issue at existing worker scope
    Scoped --> Entry: Take once + exact request
    Scoped --> Spent: mismatching request or restart
    Entry --> Spent: normal path drops authority before effects
    Entry --> Rollback: pre-record failure / move proof
    Entry --> Recording: set recording before record attempt
    Recording --> Observed: by-value handoff / FS load and equality
    Recording --> Spent: record or observation error / no rollback
    Observed --> OwnerLock: begin DB transaction
    Rollback --> OwnerLock: begin DB transaction
    OwnerLock --> RowLock: SELECT FOR UPDATE
    RowLock --> Prepared: exact payload + claim + owner stamp + marker CAS; existing retire fence
    Prepared --> Held: hold commit
    Prepared --> PendingRearm: rollback commit / preserve bookkeeping
    Prepared --> Spent: rejected CAS or transaction abort
    Held --> PendingReleased: exact stable receipt + live owner / commit once
    PendingRearm --> Claimed: reclaim / keep marker
    PendingReleased --> Claimed: reclaim / keep released marker
    Held --> Held: second release is an idempotent no-op
    Spent --> [*]
